<title>USA: Quebec agency cuts BioChem Pharma stake.</title>
<headline>Quebec agency cuts BioChem Pharma stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caisse de depot et placement du Quebec said Wednesday it reduced its stake in BioChem Pharma Inc to 4.96 percent or 2,764,336 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the Quebec investment agency said it sold 830,000 shares of BioChem between September 23 and November 6 at prices ranging from C$51.32 to C$62.46 a share.</p>
<p>The agency said it holds its stake in the Quebec-based biopharmaceutical company for investment purposes.</p>
</text>
